      },
      "writtenOn": "2010-08-24T16:49:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not talking about the communication with the ril but rather the communication with dcTracker. What I was trying to point out was that in the original code when powerOffRadioSafely is called the dcTracker.sendMessage is *always* sent back to the dcTracker. In the new code it is only sent *sometimes* (i.e. in this case I was referring to both else clauses) the main point was that it was only sent sometimes.",
      "parentUuid": "AAAA6H///pM\u003d",
      "revId": "7620c79047b8bc08afa3470bf73f15078e8c6563",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
